                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "74436c45-a614-321b-9099-dad549a72e16",
                        "entry_id": "eaa056cd-8af3-3756-9192-47af16ef9eee",
                        "glosses": [
                            "техн. устройство в виде клапана или заслонки для уменьшения давления проходящих через него по трубам пара, газа или жидкости"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "cb7d5daa-f810-3aaa-add6-030ad14e5b80",
                        "entry_id": "eaa056cd-8af3-3756-9192-47af16ef9eee",
                        "glosses": [
                            "эл.-техн. катушка, включаемая в электрическую цепь для регулирования силы тока"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "42a36168-0681-4bcc-ba81-126122039afc",
                                "sense_id": "cb7d5daa-f810-3aaa-add6-030ad14e5b80",
                                "text": "Если вторичная обмотка трансформатора разомкнута и ток в ней отсутствует, то трансформатор является обычным дросселем, индуктивностью с железным сердечником, рассмотренным выше."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "1250a0fe-1ec1-4a79-9b6a-65318b9e5775",
                        "source_entry_id": "eaa056cd-8af3-3756-9192-47af16ef9eee",
                        "source_sense_description": "гидравлический",
                        "target_lang_word": "throttle",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "throttle",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "79c4d89a-9eac-3bd1-afc3-3991ac2f68b7",
                                        "entry_id": "6c3ff71f-2a8e-3d9d-ae2d-546d01c346a4",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A valve that regulates the supply of fuel-air mixture to an internal combustion engine and thus controls its speed; a similar valve that controls the air supply to an engine."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2162cefe-d9de-3795-9de6-8e54d4eb7d55",
                                        "entry_id": "6c3ff71f-2a8e-3d9d-ae2d-546d01c346a4",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The lever or pedal that controls this valve."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e58722ca-d79d-4ec1-a7b7-3edff5945997",
                                                "sense_id": "2162cefe-d9de-3795-9de6-8e54d4eb7d55",
                                                "text": "To my unpractised eye, the undulations in the track were quite imperceptible, but the engineer's hand on the throttle was never still."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "83069936-1fb7-3238-a5c0-949191f906e3",
                                        "entry_id": "6c3ff71f-2a8e-3d9d-ae2d-546d01c346a4",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The windpipe or trachea."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "archaic"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "612118b7-1a64-4e1f-81e4-b2a1eadde48e",
                                                "sense_id": "83069936-1fb7-3238-a5c0-949191f906e3",
                                                "text": "Then up got Peg, and round the house gan scuttle, / In search of goods her customer to nail, / Until the Sultaun strain'd his princely throttle, / And hollow'd,—\"Ma'am, that is not what I ail.[\"]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e5348f65-b5c0-409b-bd46-09efdc0d4033",
                                                "sense_id": "83069936-1fb7-3238-a5c0-949191f906e3",
                                                "text": "Nor took a punch nor given a swing, / But just soaked deady round the ring / Until their brains and bloods were foul / Enough to make their throttles howl, […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "395bd933-0544-46b7-890b-17ecf49e5e27",
                                                "sense_id": "83069936-1fb7-3238-a5c0-949191f906e3",
                                                "text": "From the cabin came that horrible song: \"Here's to the feet wot have walked the plank. ⁠Yo ho! for the dead man's throttle.\""
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "throttle",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "15dcac4a-9f6a-35ad-9ce8-65365ff03b3e",
                                        "entry_id": "1d9ce2d3-7421-37dc-b39a-03e48c8885bc",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To control or adjust the speed of (an engine)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ecd2a833-8b36-348b-93df-b426f80eb950",
                                        "entry_id": "1d9ce2d3-7421-37dc-b39a-03e48c8885bc",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To cut back on the speed of (an engine, person, organization, network connection, etc.)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3cd32e18-8bfd-300c-a0ad-747bd851674b",
                                        "entry_id": "1d9ce2d3-7421-37dc-b39a-03e48c8885bc",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To strangle or choke someone."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2dd90082-a3fc-4ac8-91d5-1ecec7ebabcc",
                                                "sense_id": "3cd32e18-8bfd-300c-a0ad-747bd851674b",
                                                "text": "Grant him this, and the Parliament hath no more freedom than if it sat in his noose, which, when he pleases to draw together with one twitch of his negative, shall throttle a whole nation, to the wish of Caligula, in one neck."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2e583f2f-87a4-3853-a845-03e5d1b61c94",
                                        "entry_id": "1d9ce2d3-7421-37dc-b39a-03e48c8885bc",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To have the throat obstructed so as to be in danger of suffocation; to choke; to suffocate."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "intransitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "fda77b7b-717d-3b1e-a743-2ed82964b3a4",
                                        "entry_id": "1d9ce2d3-7421-37dc-b39a-03e48c8885bc",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To breathe hard, as when nearly suffocated."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "intransitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "35eb8552-4afa-3c74-9a38-e0a791e0aac6",
                                        "entry_id": "1d9ce2d3-7421-37dc-b39a-03e48c8885bc",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To utter with breaks and interruption, in the manner of a person half suffocated."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "496ba4c3-d089-4e70-b9f9-05aa668c5cce",
                                                "sense_id": "35eb8552-4afa-3c74-9a38-e0a791e0aac6",
                                                "text": "I have seen them shiver and look pale,\nMake periods in the midst of sentences,\nThrottle their practised accent in their fears."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "b3b48270-5a32-4ef5-8397-ce11baca4590",
                        "source_entry_id": "eaa056cd-8af3-3756-9192-47af16ef9eee",
                        "source_sense_description": "катушка индуктивности",
                        "target_lang_word": "inductor",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "inductor",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "40b3a81e-415a-3701-9ab2-56a458f97826",
                                        "entry_id": "1a320d24-545c-3266-bb7e-ae44c3c4b7cd",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A passive device that introduces inductance into an electrical circuit."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0d54c979-f34d-3869-8b88-52a8f4c3867c",
                                        "entry_id": "1a320d24-545c-3266-bb7e-ae44c3c4b7cd",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An evocator or an organizer."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "87cc49e3-5063-3699-ac18-9c9c842e1e74",
                                        "entry_id": "1a320d24-545c-3266-bb7e-ae44c3c4b7cd",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "One who, or that which, inducts."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cb1ea8ce-88e5-4f4f-8de6-9bfdd9278af0",
                                                "sense_id": "87cc49e3-5063-3699-ac18-9c9c842e1e74",
                                                "text": "In certain families one can find several “inductees” grouped around one influential “inductor.” I have observed the case of a forever complaining old lady, living with her married daughter, who attracted and shut everybody, mother, father, and two daughters, into the closed circle of their mutual and reciprocal lamentations."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b15f4244-9105-487e-8f84-bbe93f02e90f",
                                                "sense_id": "87cc49e3-5063-3699-ac18-9c9c842e1e74",
                                                "text": "He should take all efforts to see that a personal link is well established and he should shape the person in a very healthy way. The success of this lies in the capability of the inductor also who should be able to draw out the interests of the inductees."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8c628e3c-bf1f-4791-91bf-4fb514a27024",
                                                "sense_id": "87cc49e3-5063-3699-ac18-9c9c842e1e74",
                                                "text": "The vertices of the induced graph (called inductees) are a subset of the vertices of the original graph. The induction can be limited to common neighbors in a certain subset of vertices of the original graph, called the subset of inductors. Each inductor induces edges between the inductees."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e9fe60cc-ba1c-4229-b494-5e6b7320cdba",
                                                "sense_id": "87cc49e3-5063-3699-ac18-9c9c842e1e74",
                                                "text": "Employee induction is practised in this country by many establishments in some form or the other and with varying degree of emphasis. […] It is natural for an inductee to look to the inductor for correct information as and when he finds the real-life situations out of line with what was conveyed."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "402d39f6-a796-4488-a62d-f52885a6eef7",
                                                "sense_id": "87cc49e3-5063-3699-ac18-9c9c842e1e74",
                                                "text": "Amrolia had inducted his son Jamshed together with that person’s wife and two children to stay with him in the flat afore-mentioned. Later on, relations between the inductor and inductees deteriorated."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "548fb1ac-bc99-4903-87b6-27f967ca8040",
                                                "sense_id": "87cc49e3-5063-3699-ac18-9c9c842e1e74",
                                                "text": "When honoree Kenny G. was asked if he had attended Woodstock, he replied, “No, I was just being bar mitzvahed then, so that was more important than being at Woodstock.” His inductor, Jon Lovitz, jumped in and said, “I’m not as religious as [Kenny]; I’d rather have been at Woodstock.”"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fc266f82-290a-4636-8e55-428bcb595995",
                                                "sense_id": "87cc49e3-5063-3699-ac18-9c9c842e1e74",
                                                "text": "Inductor Graham Nash seized on the on-again, off-again feud between brothers Ray and Dave Davies, noting that he hoped there were enough awards because “I don’t want to see the brothers fighting again.”"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3785c23e-e2be-4526-8eaf-d075453fcd92",
                                                "sense_id": "87cc49e3-5063-3699-ac18-9c9c842e1e74",
                                                "text": "Breitbard, having served as inductor of numerous athletes into the Breitbard Hall of Fame for more than fifty years, finally became the inductee in 2006."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
